# Stitcher client-mix media (forever lock)

**Canon:** `Production/docs/TECH_SPEC_STITCH_DRY_AUTHORITY_CLIENT_MIX_V1.md` §2.1  
**Markers:** `STITCH_DRY_HOT_SERVE_PLAYBACK_V1` · `STITCH_SFX_HOT_SERVE_PREFETCH_V1`

## Required

| Surface | Must |
|---------|------|
| Dry / four-files composer `<video>` | Bind **only** after `playback_resolve` → `/api/media/playback/…` |
| Default start/finish SFX | `prefetchAllSfx` on **attach**; play schedules from warm cache |
| SFX `/files` fetch | Retry **503/429**; audit `SFX_LOAD_FAILED` on hard fail |
| Attach / play forensics | `SFX_PREFETCH` + `SFX_SCHEDULE` / `SFX_RESYNC` with `sfx_scheduled` |

## Forbidden

- First SFX `fetch` only inside play/`scheduleSfxFromCurrentTime` (no attach prefetch)
- Binding dry-slot video to cold `/files?path=` when hot-serve fails (no silent `/files` fallback)
- Swallowing SFX load errors with only `console.warn` and no audit
- timeupdate drift-resync that stop/reschedules SFX every ~250ms
- Treating mid-play demux / `PLAYBACK_CACHE_MISS` as a permanent “Warm serve failed” without re-resolve (`STITCH_HOT_PLAYBACK_RERESOLVE_V1`)

## Before marking Stitcher media work done

1. `bash Production/scripts/verify_stitch_sfx_playback_truth_durability.sh` — green  
2. `bash Production/scripts/verify_stitch_dry_authority_client_mix_durability.sh` — green  
3. Option B deploy; live audit on Resolution: prefetch loaded=N, play `@t≈0` → `sfx_scheduled` matches cues  
4. Phase B (and other dry slots): after deploy, playback past ~20s must not strand on a dead `pb_*` token — error audits `COMPOSER_HOT_PLAYBACK_ERROR` and re-warms  
